</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1019)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Alerts come to the front.</b> Errors, confirmations and Open/Save windows no longer hide behind the floating panels (Share, Review Manager, grade); the panels step back while one is up and float again after.</li>
<li>When a review's clips can't be found, the message names them and says why &#8212; the drive isn't mounted, or they aren't in their folder any more.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
